  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/18RsKn1.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&color=252a36&labelColor=5865F2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=252A36&labelColor=FF424D&logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&color=252a36&labelColor=1D9BF0&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>关于：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p>Mandala GUI 是一款优雅的界面主题，采用 Mandala Creations 的设计风格。<br>专为喜欢深色模式的用户打造。<br>它仅更改 Minecraft 的用户界面（UI），不会改变任何物品或方块的纹理。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>界面采用深色模式。</li>\n<li>扁平化现代配色。</li>\n<li>蓝灰色系配色方案。</li>\n<li>兼容各类模组（完整列表请见文件描述）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">对模组和替代纹理的支持</span></strong>将迁移至 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - Add-Ons</a> [完全迁移所有附加组件需要一定时间]。❤</span></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on/files/4523692\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oYbBBdq.gif\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>兼容模组（目前已支持77个）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>aether [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>alexsmobs [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>animal_feeding_trough&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>appleskin [1.19.4]&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><em><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/download/4532243\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Exhaustion White - CLICK HERE]</a></em></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong>aquaculture [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>armorpointspp [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>backpacked [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>betteradvancements [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>betterend [1.19.4]&nbsp;[forge, fabric]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>blue_skies [1.19.4] - <em><span style=\"color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/download/4725481\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1.16.5 FIX - CLICK HERE] </a></span></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>botanypots&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>cfm [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>chococraft&nbsp;[1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>cloth-config2&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>corpse [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>cosmeticarmorreworked [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>craftingtweaks [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>crafting tweaks [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>create [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>curios [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>dannys_expansion [1.18.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>disenchanting [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>easy_piglins&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>easy_villagers&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>easyanvils&nbsp;[1.19.3] [forge, fabric]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>elevatorid&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>enchantinginfuser&nbsp;[1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ender_chested [1.20]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>evilcraft&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>evilcraftcompat&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>expandedstorage [1.20]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>forbidden_arcanus [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>goldenhopper [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>guardvillagers&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>healthoverlay&nbsp;[1.19.3] [forge, fabric]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>hexerei&nbsp;[1.19.2]&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><em><a style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/download/4524185\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1.16.5 FIX - CLICK HERE]</a></em></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong>iceandfire [1.18.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ironchest [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ironchests restocket [1.19.2] [forge, fabric]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ironfurnaces [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>itemswapper [1.19.4] [fabric]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>jade&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>jei [1.20]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>jeresources [1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>justenoughprofessions&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>malum [1.18.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>mowziesmobs [1.18.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>netherchested [1.20]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>omnis_backpacks [1.16.5]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>oreexcavation&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>overflowingbars [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>paradise_lost [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>quark [1.12.2]&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><em><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/download/4531995\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1.16.5 FIX - CLICK HERE]</a></em></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong>reliquary [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>rootsclassic&nbsp;[1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>roughlyenoughitems&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>screenshot_viewer&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>smallships [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>sophisticatedbackpacks [1.20.1]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>sophisticatedcore [1.20.1]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>sophisticatedstorage [1.20.1]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>spartanweaponry [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>storagedrawers [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>storagenetwork [1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>supplementaries [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>toolbelt [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>trade_cycling [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>trashslot [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>travelersbackpack&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>trinkets [1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>twilightforest&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>usefulbackpacks&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>waterstrainer&nbsp;[1.19.3]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>waystones&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>wearablebackpacks&nbsp;[1.19.2]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>xaero minimap&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>xaero betterpvp&nbsp;[1.19.4]</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;如果您喜欢我的像素艺术风格，也可以尝试：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Perspective</a> [兼容多个 Minecraft 版本、其他材质包及模组]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Veganicon</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷栏</a> [需手动下载并复制]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Brewing Guide On</a> [原版风格]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https: